ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa129: OPEN_SHELL: single PLANE ADVANCED_FACE 4×2 rectangle; top edge is B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS degree=3 with asymmetric internal knot at 0.3 (knots=[0.0,0.3,1.0], mults=[4,1,4]); T-junction vertex at 3D midpoint does NOT correspond to parameter u=0.5 due to non-uniform B-spline parameterization; ShapeAnalysis_CheckSmallFace::CheckSplittingVertices checks u=0.5 and misses the actual T-vertex (geometric midpoint ≠ parametric midpoint); defect IS on live OPEN_SHELL traversal path */
